{"id":"aecb6d885cba1a31","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-hahn-banach.md","title":"Hahn–Banach Theorem","display":"df-hahn-banach — Hahn–Banach Theorem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hahn-banach","aliases":["58-df-hahn-banach"],"display":"df-hahn-banach — Hahn–Banach Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-sublinear.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hahn-banach"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hahn-banach</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hahn-banach — Hahn–Banach Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1191b8d1afa11034\" href=\"?note=1191b8d1afa11034\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-sublinear.md\">../batch03/58-df-sublinear.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,M,+_X,\\odot_X,+_M,\\odot_M\\in V\">\\(X,M,+_X,\\odot_X,+_M,\\odot_M\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb R^X\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb R^X\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathbb R^M\">\\(f\\in\\mathbb R^M\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sublinear},\\operatorname{Majorizes}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sublinear},\\operatorname{Majorizes}\\)</span> (predicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1191b8d1afa11034\" href=\"?note=1191b8d1afa11034\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-sublinear.md\">../batch03/58-df-sublinear.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> (fully explicit linear-map predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f67456d74b418241\" href=\"?note=f67456d74b418241\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md\">../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> (real-vector-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HahnBanachExtension}_S\\subseteq V^9\">\\(\\mathrm{HahnBanachExtension}_S\\subseteq V^9\\)</span> (Hahn-Banach extension predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hahn\\text{-}banach}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HahnBanachExtension}_S(\\widetilde f,f,M,X,p,+_X,\\odot_X,+_M,\\odot_M)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+_X,\\odot_X)\n\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(M,+_M,\\odot_M)\n\\land M\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;\\land +_M=+_X\\upharpoonright(M\\times M)\n\\land\\odot_M=\\odot_X\\upharpoonright(\\mathbb R\\times M)\n\\land\\operatorname{Sublinear}(p,X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(f,M,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R,+_M,\\odot_M,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\operatorname{Majorizes}(p,f,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(\\widetilde f,X,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R,+_X,\\odot_X,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\widetilde f\\upharpoonright M=f\n\\land\\operatorname{Majorizes}(p,\\widetilde f,X).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hahn\\text{-}banach}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HahnBanachExtension}_S(\\widetilde f,f,M,X,p,+_X,\\odot_X,+_M,\\odot_M)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+_X,\\odot_X)\n\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(M,+_M,\\odot_M)\n\\land M\\subseteq X\\\\\n&amp;\\land +_M=+_X\\upharpoonright(M\\times M)\n\\land\\odot_M=\\odot_X\\upharpoonright(\\mathbb R\\times M)\n\\land\\operatorname{Sublinear}(p,X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(f,M,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R,+_M,\\odot_M,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\operatorname{Majorizes}(p,f,M)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(\\widetilde f,X,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R,+_X,\\odot_X,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\widetilde f\\upharpoonright M=f\n\\land\\operatorname{Majorizes}(p,\\widetilde f,X).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom defines valid Hahn–Banach extension data. Norm formulas and existence of norming functionals are downstream theorems and have been removed from the definition.</li>\n<li>Separation theorems: convex set separation</li>\n<li>Geometric form: bounding hyperplane separates convex sets</li>\n<li>Analytic form: norm preservation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Functional Analysis</li>\n<li>Conway, A Course in Functional Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-sublinear.md","status":"resolved","id":"1191b8d1afa11034","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-sublinear.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-sublinear.md","status":"resolved","id":"1191b8d1afa11034","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Sublinear},\\operatorname{Majorizes}$ (predicates from [[../batch03/58-df-sublinear.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\subseteq V^8$ (fully explicit linear-map predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}$ (real-vector-space predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,M,+_X,\\odot_X,+_M,\\odot_M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathbb R^X","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathbb R^M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sublinear},\\operatorname{Majorizes}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HahnBanachExtension}_S\\subseteq V^9","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hahn\\text{-}banach}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{HahnBanachExtension}_S(\\widetilde f,f,M,X,p,+_X,\\odot_X,+_M,\\odot_M)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(X,+_X,\\odot_X)\n\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb R}(M,+_M,\\odot_M)\n\\land M\\subseteq X\\\\\n&\\land +_M=+_X\\upharpoonright(M\\times M)\n\\land\\odot_M=\\odot_X\\upharpoonright(\\mathbb R\\times M)\n\\land\\operatorname{Sublinear}(p,X,+_X,\\odot_X)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(f,M,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R,+_M,\\odot_M,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\operatorname{Majorizes}(p,f,M)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(\\widetilde f,X,\\mathbb R,\\mathbb R,+_X,\\odot_X,+_{\\mathbb R},\\cdot_{\\mathbb R})\n\\land\\widetilde f\\upharpoonright M=f\n\\land\\operatorname{Majorizes}(p,\\widetilde f,X).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2095,"backlinks":[{"id":"afa6c85c498f53e7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-601","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-hahn-banach.md|58-df-hahn-banach]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["1191b8d1afa11034","f67456d74b418241","592f9cfb66a507c2"]}